"P00331",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[142].table.rows[4].cells[3].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 29329,
      "endIndex": 29493,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 27575,
        "rowIndex": 4,
        "columnIndex": 3
      },
      "text": "[Wing Joo Loong](https://www.wjl.com.sg/products/wing-joo-loong-lung-soothing-summer-tea) markets the pre-packed blend as Lung Soothing Summer Tea, formerly Five Flower Tea, with unchanged ingredients. This is an external product example.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00332",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[142].table.rows[5].cells[0].content[0]",
