      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 27575,
        "rowIndex": 5,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "Monk fruit tea\u000b罗汉果茶",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00334",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[142].table.rows[5].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 29518,
      "endIndex": 29604,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 27575,
        "rowIndex": 5,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "Monk fruit ([Siraitia grosvenorii](https://www.nparks.gov.sg/florafaunaweb/flora/7/0/7027)) is native to southern China and northern Thailand. ",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00335",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[142].table.rows[5].cells[2].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 29605,
      "endIndex": 29764,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 27575,
        "rowIndex": 5,
        "columnIndex": 2
      },
      "text": "Documented local example: [Heng Foh Tong’s HFTea Herbal Tea Cooling Drink](https://hftea.sg/products/hftea-herbal-tea-cooling-drink) contains monk fruit and is produced by a licensed beverage manufacturer in Singapore.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00336",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[142].table.rows[5].cells[3].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 29765,
      "endIndex": 29933,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 27575,
        "rowIndex": 5,
        "columnIndex": 3
      },
      "text": "[Heng Foh Tong](https://hftea.sg/products/hftea-herbal-tea-cooling-drink) markets this ready-to-drink beverage under HFTea. It demonstrates local beverage production; it does not identify the maker or packer of Tong Keow’s tea.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
